#: src/app/device/review.rs:366
msgid "The player changed {} track(s) of your collection since the last export ({} more on the device are not in your collection and stay as they are). Tick what to bring into your collection: each tick replaces your value of that track with the player's. Nothing changes until you press APPLY, and UNDO afterwards restores exactly these fields."
